So Basically all you have to know:
1. Enemy.py contains the code for enemies or whatever you are fighting in the game really.
2. Keybinds.py contains the code for keybind handling basically.
3. myGameIG.py contrains the code that you actually run for the game to work. (Think of it as 
the main method in java)
4. person.py contains the code for the Point Of View that you have in the game and or the 
character that you control
5. styleStuff is for styling such as fonts and all other things that you use to style really
6. startingPage.py contains the code to create the front page that opens up when you run the code.